issue.description:
**PRD:** https://rnd.frontiir.net/en/products/rt/requirements/noc-ticket-automation-prd

Legacy tickets are referenced only as plain text and stay unchanged until the team agrees the plan below.

**Plan items:**

- decide per ticket whether to close as superseded, convert, or keep as a Feature under Epic #22947;
- correct #21613 component 5 (says a 30-day Remote Resolve window; the decision is 14 days) and its duplicate AC16 and AC25 numbering;
- correct the AC-17 comment text in #22265;
- status hygiene (#21613 and #21503 are In Progress at 0% with passed due dates);
- close #22265 as superseded only after its content is confirmed covered by the PRD and the Stories;
- map commits that reference other Redmine numbers (for example #20789 and #21573) to the new Stories with a note, without rewriting history;
- link #22497 (Peppermint/CPEMS) to this Epic as a cross-project relation only when the team agrees.

**Done when:** the team has agreed the plan and each legacy ticket has a recorded decision.
